; Command line for BetterEndfield.TouchProbe.exe, one line, first non-comment
; line wins. Lives here rather than in BetterEndfield.ini because the launcher
; UI rewrites that file wholesale and would delete anything it does not model.
;
; Default with no arguments: anchored at the centre of the screen.
;   <x> <y>            anchor the contact at these screen coordinates
;   --follow-cursor    follow the mouse instead (useless once the game hides it)
;   --skip-self-test   skip the startup self-test window
;
; Example:
; 300 800 --skip-self-test
